WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.434
With scripts off, the button does nothing.

00:00:04.434 --> 00:00:07.819
First, turn on Allow external resources.

00:00:07.819 --> 00:00:11.212
Then turn on Run scripts.

00:00:11.212 --> 00:00:14.022
Click Test button again.

00:00:14.022 --> 00:00:17.526
Clicked confirms the inline code ran.
